      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That would be a great feature and benefit. It would be even more immersive for desktop players to be able to move around more naturally.\n\nThe build in Selfie Expression is already a good feature but lacks in some movements (arms and hands can't get backward, no real body movement, gestures for e.g. grabbing aren't working).\n\nIt would make VRChat even nicer!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-13T10:32:45.264Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please allow Desktop users to use OSC tracker data for full body tracking without requiring a VR headset or SteamVR. Many users have mocap setups, webcams, or external trackers but cannot use them in Desktop mode. This would improve accessibility, content creation, performances, and roleplay while making use of the existing OSC tracker system.\n\n(This text was translated, so there may be some inaccuracies. I apologize if there are any mistakes.)\n\nI love VRchat.",
